#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/landsat.md:1
msgid "Landsat Extraction"
msgstr "Landsat 提取"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/landsat.md:13
msgid ""
"Not wired into `PyGeoFetch` (there's no `client.landsat`) — always a "
"standalone import, unlike `client.indices`/`client.sar`."
msgstr ""
"未接入 `PyGeoFetch`（没有 `client.landsat`）— 始终是独立导入，这与 "
"`client.indices`/`client.sar` 不同。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/landsat.md:16
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概览"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/landsat.md:18
msgid ""
"Landsat has the longest continuous optical record available, but its "
"products need careful handling: band numbers differ between sensor "
"generations, reflectance and temperature values are stored as scaled "
"integers, and quality information is packed into a bit mask. "
"`LandsatExtractor` takes a downloaded Landsat scene and returns a ready-to-"
"use object with correctly named bands, scale factors applied and, if you ask"
" for it, clouds and shadows masked."
msgstr ""
"Landsat "
"拥有现有最长的连续光学记录，但其产品需要谨慎处理：不同传感器世代的波段编号不同，反射率和温度值以缩放整数存储，质量信息则打包在位掩码中。`LandsatExtractor`"
" 接收已下载的 Landsat 场景，并返回一个可直接使用的对象，其波段命名正确、已应用缩放因子，并且在你需要时还会掩膜云和阴影。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/landsat.md:20
msgid ""
"You normally use it right after a USGS download. Pass the download result, "
"receive a scene object, and ask it for bands by name, for example red and "
"near infrared, instead of remembering which numbered file holds which band "
"for Landsat 5, 7, 8 or 9. Because the output is consistent across sensors, "
"the same index code can be run over decades of imagery, which is what makes "
"Landsat suitable for long time series."
msgstr ""
"通常在 USGS 下载之后立即使用它。传入下载结果，得到一个场景对象，然后按名称（例如红光和近红外）请求波段，而不必记住 Landsat 5、7、8 或"
" 9 中哪个编号的文件对应哪个波段。由于不同传感器的输出保持一致，同一套指数代码可以在数十年的影像上运行，这正是 Landsat 适合长时间序列的原因。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/landsat.md:22
msgid "Two easy-to-get-wrong things this handles"
msgstr "它处理的两个容易出错的问题"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/landsat.md:24
msgid ""
"**Band mapping differs by sensor.** OLI (Landsat 8/9) and TM/ETM+ (4/5/7) "
"use different band numbers for the same wavelength — `SR_B4` is Red on OLI, "
"NIR on TM/ETM+. Sensor is auto-detected from the filename "
"(`_detect_sensor()`) and the correct map applied."
msgstr ""
"**波段映射因传感器而异。** OLI（Landsat 8/9）与 TM/ETM+（4/5/7）对同一波长使用不同的波段编号 — `SR_B4` 在 "
"OLI 上是红光，在 TM/ETM+ 上是近红外。系统会根据文件名自动检测传感器（`_detect_sensor()`）并应用正确的映射。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/landsat.md:28
msgid ""
"**Delivery format differs by provider.** Not every provider delivers one "
"archive — Planetary Computer downloads each band as its own separate asset "
"file (`SR_B4.TIF`, `SR_B5.TIF`, `QA_PIXEL.TIF`, ...) rather than one `.tar` "
"bundle, so `DownloadResult.output_paths` holds many files, not one. "
"`process_scene()` detects this automatically (`_resolve_individual_files()`)"
" and uses those files directly, skipping tar extraction entirely — the same "
"call works regardless of which delivery style the provider used."
msgstr ""
"**交付格式因提供方而异。** 并非所有提供方都交付单一归档文件 — Planetary Computer "
"将每个波段作为独立的资产文件下载（`SR_B4.TIF`、`SR_B5.TIF`、`QA_PIXEL.TIF` 等），而不是一个 `.tar` 包，因此"
" `DownloadResult.output_paths` 包含多个文件，而不是一个。`process_scene()` "
"会自动检测这种情况（`_resolve_individual_files()`），直接使用这些文件，完全跳过 tar 解压 — "
"无论提供方采用哪种交付方式，同一个调用都适用。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/landsat.md:37
msgid "`process_scene()` — the full chain"
msgstr "`process_scene()` — 完整处理链"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/landsat.md:45
msgid ""
"The full chain in one call: extract bundle → scale bands → cloud-mask → "
"return. `source` accepts a `DownloadResult` (preferred — uses "
"`.output_path`/`.output_paths` directly) or a direct path to a `.tar` "
"bundle. `bands` defaults to "
"`[\"blue\",\"green\",\"red\",\"nir\",\"swir1\",\"swir2\"]` — pass fewer for "
"faster processing when you only need, e.g., `[\"red\",\"nir\"]` for NDVI. "
"`label` namespaces the extraction subfolder when processing multiple scenes "
"into the same `output_dir` (e.g. `label=\"before\"` / `label=\"after\"` for "
"change detection). `mask_clouds` overrides the instance-level setting for "
"just this call."
msgstr ""
"一次调用完成完整处理链：解压归档 → 缩放波段 → 云掩膜 → 返回。`source` 接受 `DownloadResult`（推荐 — 直接使用 "
"`.output_path`/`.output_paths`）或指向 `.tar` 包的直接路径。`bands` 默认为 "
"`[\"blue\",\"green\",\"red\",\"nir\",\"swir1\",\"swir2\"]` — 如果只需要例如用于 NDVI "
"的 `[\"red\",\"nir\"]`，可以传入更少的波段以加快处理。`label` 在将多个场景处理到同一个 `output_dir` "
"时，为解压子文件夹命名空间（例如变化检测时使用 `label=\"before\"` / "
"`label=\"after\"`）。`mask_clouds` 仅对本次调用覆盖实例级别的设置。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/landsat.md:56
msgid "Individual building-block methods"
msgstr "单独的构建模块方法"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/landsat.md:58
msgid ""
"`process_scene()` is a convenience wrapper — each step is also independently"
" callable:"
msgstr "`process_scene()` 是一个便捷封装 — 其中每个步骤也都可以单独调用："

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/landsat.md:0
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方法"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/landsat.md:0
msgid "What it does"
msgstr "功能说明"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/landsat.md:0
msgid "`extract_bundle(tar_path, output_dir)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/landsat.md:0
msgid ""
"Extract every band + QA GeoTIFF from a Landsat C2L2 `.tar` bundle. Returns "
"`{member_filename: extracted_path}`."
msgstr ""
"从 Landsat C2L2 `.tar` 包中提取所有波段和 QA GeoTIFF。返回 `{member_filename: "
"extracted_path}`。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/landsat.md:0
msgid "`load_scaled_band(path)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/landsat.md:0
msgid ""
"Load one band and apply the correct **official USGS scale factor + offset**,"
" auto-selected by band type (surface reflectance `SR_B*` vs. surface "
"temperature `ST_B*`). Fill pixels (`DN=0`, the Collection 2 fill value) "
"become NaN. Returns `(scaled_array, rasterio_profile)`."
msgstr ""
"加载一个波段并应用正确的**官方 USGS 缩放因子 + 偏移量**，按波段类型自动选择（地表反射率 `SR_B*` 或地表温度 "
"`ST_B*`）。填充像元（`DN=0`，即 Collection 2 的填充值）会变为 NaN。返回 `(scaled_array, "
"rasterio_profile)`。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/landsat.md:0
msgid "`cloud_mask(qa_pixel_path, shape=None)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/landsat.md:0
msgid ""
"Decode Landsat Collection 2 `QA_PIXEL` bit flags into a cloud/shadow mask "
"(`True` = masked out). Checks bits 1 (Dilated Cloud), 3 (Cloud), and 4 "
"(Cloud Shadow) per the official Landsat 8-9 C2 Level-2 Science Product "
"Guide, Table 6-2/6-3 — the same bit positions apply across the full Landsat "
"4-9 Collection 2 `QA_PIXEL` spec."
msgstr ""
"将 Landsat Collection 2 的 `QA_PIXEL` 位标志解码为云/阴影掩膜（`True` = 被掩掉）。依据官方《Landsat "
"8-9 C2 Level-2 科学产品指南》表 6-2/6-3，检查第 1 位（膨胀云）、第 3 位（云）和第 4 位（云阴影）— "
"相同的位位置适用于整个 Landsat 4-9 Collection 2 `QA_PIXEL` 规范。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/landsat.md:0
msgid "`find_band(extracted_files, band_suffix)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/landsat.md:0
msgid "Look up an extracted file by band suffix, e.g. `\"SR_B4\"` or `\"QA_PIXEL\"`."
msgstr "按波段后缀查找已提取的文件，例如 `\"SR_B4\"` 或 `\"QA_PIXEL\"`。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/landsat.md:80
msgid "`LandsatScene` — the returned object"
msgstr "`LandsatScene` — 返回的对象"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/landsat.md:88
msgid "Verification basis"
msgstr "验证依据"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/landsat.md:90
msgid ""
"Radiometric scaling verified against USGS's own worked examples: DN 18639 → "
"0.313 reflectance; DN 44947 → 302.6 K. Cloud masking decodes `QA_PIXEL` bits"
" per the official Science Product Guide, not an approximated threshold."
msgstr ""
"辐射定标已对照 USGS 自己的示例验证：DN 18639 → 反射率 0.313；DN 44947 → 302.6 K。云掩膜按官方科学产品指南解码 "
"`QA_PIXEL` 位，而不是近似的阈值。"
